  "description": "The FRS PARK is made for the bike park and is built with reliable and efficient components.\n• The ROCKSHOX BoXXer fork is reliable and proven. Equipped with the DebonAir + air spring and a Charger 3 RC cartridge, it offers simple and precise rebound and low-speed compression adjustments.The VIVID Coil Base shock combines impeccable sensitivity and excellent mid-stroke support thanks to its coil spring.\n• TRP DHR EVO PRO brakes are renowned for their constant power and control, even on the most technical descents.\n• DT SWISS F1900 wheels are specially designed for riding bike park. They are strong and reliable.\n• A SRAM GX DH 7-speed drivetrain is precise and perfect for downhill.",
